{{! Application-level error substate (CC-121) — the universal safety net.

  Any route whose model() rejects without being handled closer in lands here
  instead of white-screening the SPA. It renders into the application route's
  outlet, which application.hbs puts inside <MainApplication> (the
  `chromeless` getter only fires for 'profile', and during the substate the
  current route is 'error'), so the sidebar and top-bar survive — the visible
  difference between "the app broke" and "that thing isn't there".

  Deliberately NOT wrapped in <RouteLayout>: that renders <Breadcrumbs />,
  which derives its trail from the current route, and during an error substate
  there is no meaningful trail to draw. The dashed-border card below is the
  same one profile.hbs uses for its not-found state.

  404 vs everything-else is decided by ErrorController#is404 → isNotFound
  (app/utils/is-not-found.js), which reads ember-data's typed NotFoundError.
  A 5xx or a network drop falls to the else branch.

  This header uses the LONG comment form on purpose. The short form ends at
  the first closing pair of braces it meets, so a comment that mentions a
  mustache by name — as this one did in its first draft — terminates early and
  spills the remaining prose into the template as live markup. That is a build
  error, not a lint warning: it read as an unclosed <RouteLayout> element. }}
{{page-title (if this.is404 "Not found — Career Caddy" "Error — Career Caddy")}}

<div class="fairway">
  {{#if this.is404}}
    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-gray-300 px-6 py-16 text-center dark:border-gray-700"
      data-test-error-404
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        class="mx-auto size-12 text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.5"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="M9.75 9.75l4.5 4.5m0-4.5l-4.5 4.5M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"
        />
      </svg>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-base font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        We couldn't find that
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
        The record you asked for doesn't exist, or it isn't yours. Check the id
        in the address bar — ids from one section don't resolve in another.
      </p>
      <LinkTo @route="index" class="btn small mt-6 inline-flex">
        Back to the clubhouse
      </LinkTo>
    </div>
  {{else}}
    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-gray-300 px-6 py-16 text-center dark:border-gray-700"
      data-test-error-5xx
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        class="mx-auto size-12 text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.5"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="M12 9v3.75m9-.75a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-9 3.75h.008v.008H12v-.008z"
        />
      </svg>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-base font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        Something went wrong
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
        That request didn't come back cleanly. Try again in a moment — if it
        keeps happening, the server is having a bad time.
      </p>
      <LinkTo @route="index" class="btn small mt-6 inline-flex">
        Back to the clubhouse
      </LinkTo>
    </div>
  {{/if}}
</div>